<title>GERMANY: Spain set to buy Krauss-Maffei tanks - Bonn.</title>
<headline>Spain set to buy Krauss-Maffei tanks - Bonn.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain is set to buy 200 Leopard tanks made by Germany's Krauss-Maffei AG after the two countries reached an agreement about compensation deals, a German government official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There are no more obstacles to the purchase,&quot; said the official, who declined to be named.</p>
<p>He gave no details of the likely purchase price.</p>
<p>The agreement was reached during talks between German Defence Minister Volker Ruehe and his Spanish counterpart Eduardo Serra during bilateral consultations in Bonn.</p>
<p>Krauss-Maffei is a unit of Mannesmann AG.</p>
<p>-- Kevin Liffey, Bonn newsroom +49-228-26097160</p>
</text>
